5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy we're all chatting about this! Since we have more people now, we should figure out a way to split the bills that feels fair and keeps everyone smiling! What do you think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be practical. Before we suggest any new methods, we need to understand the actual spending patterns and the costs involved in changing our current system. Let's look at the data first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I agree with Ryuji! Let's find some cool clues first! I want to know if there's a way to make this super easy and fun. What should we check out first?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be realistic: ""fairness"" is usually just a word people use until they realize they're paying for someone else's luxury. I want to see the actual numbers before we start dreaming.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Ryuji and Shunichi. We need a clear, objective picture of the current expenses and how they've been handled before we decide on a new system. Let's start by examining the data.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you! Let's be practical. I want to check the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""The last twelve utility statements"" to see how much we've actually been spending!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I need to know the annual fluctuations in cost and if any upfront investment is required to change the setup.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to see the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and ""Monthly settle observed at another house""! I bet other houses have secret tricks to make the math super fast and easy!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll check the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled."" I want to see if the current system is actually working or if some of us are just subsidizing others.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll check the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled."" I want to see exactly how the payments have been handled and where the friction points are.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Since a few of us are checking the same things, we can compare notes later! I'm really curious if the bills have gone up a lot now that we're five people. Does anyone have any ideas already?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,It is too early for ideas. We first need to determine if the costs are seasonal or constant and if the infrastructure allows for individual tracking. Let's wait for the data to avoid making assumptions.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, you're always so serious! But I want to know if the other house has a super cool way of doing things! If we find a magic trick for the math, maybe it won't be a chore!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, there's no such thing as a ""magic trick"" for math, just different ways to hide who's getting the short end of the stick. Let's focus on the facts, not fantasies.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, you're right that we need facts. I'm particularly interested in the payment history to see if there have been delays or disputes. Let's wait for the results before we start speculating.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'll stick with my choices and see what the numbers tell us. I can't wait to find out! Let's all do our research and meet back here to share everything!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research. I will focus on the annual cost trends and the technical feasibility of changing our setup to ensure any new plan is sustainable. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! I'm going to go hunt for those secret tricks right now! I hope the other house has a way to make the bills a total breeze! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be interested to see if the payment logs reveal any hidden resentments. Let's hope the data is honest, even if the people aren't. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will begin my research now. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of the payment history and the transition period. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
